        {
          "id": 2179944260,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hi @jpeeraer, Coverity turned up the following:\n\n```\n*** CID 1633843:  Control flow issues  (DEADCODE)\n/builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-nsh.c: 244 in dissect_nsh_heur()\n238     \tconst uint8_t proto   = tvb_get_uint8(tvb, 3);\n239     \n240     \tif (version > MD_MAX_VERSION)     return false;\n241     \tif (md_type != 1 && md_type != 2) return false;\n242     \tif (md_type == 1 && length != 6)  return false;\n243     \tif (md_type == 2 && length <  2)  return false;\n>>>     CID 1633843:  Control flow issues  (DEADCODE)\n>>>     Execution cannot reach this statement: \"return false;\".\n244     \tif (length == 0)                  return false;\n245     \tif (length * 4 > tvb_length)      return false;\n246     \tif (proto == 0)                   return false;\n247     \tif (proto > NSH_MAX_PROTOCOL)     return false;\n248     \n249     \t// Note: md_type = 0x0 and md_type = 0xf are strictly speaking also valid.\n```\n\nCan you take a look?",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1788825804",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-10-26T17:14:17.535Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-30T07:38:17.352Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 336518245,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
