      "title": "NSH: add heuristic dissector",
      "message": "NSH: add heuristic dissector\n\nNSH can be first protocol-header in GTP PDU, which does not have an\nexplicit protocol field. In order to be dissectable in this case,\na heuristic dissector is created that checks some assumptions that\nshould always be met before invoking the actual dissector.\n",
      "author_name": "Joris Peeraer",
      "author_email": "joris.peeraer@nokia.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-10-23T11:54:46.000+02:00",
